{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Small town hero. Big city killer. And so many beautiful women\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870370/extras/1d07adf1ce56170a085ca64db531c1ac.poster.avif?t=1773300903\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870370/extras/1d07adf1ce56170a085ca64db531c1ac.webm?t=1773300903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870370/extras/1d07adf1ce56170a085ca64db531c1ac.mp4?t=1773300903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Middleton\u2019s favorite superhero is no stranger to fighting crime. He\u2019s been protecting his town for years against a variety of villains, both the enhanced kind and the normies.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >But when his beautiful nemesis robs the wrong jewelry store, everything changes. There\u2019s a killer on the loose, and this small-town superhero has to team up with a bunch of interesting allies\u2026the photographer with a secret, the detective with a chip on her shoulder, and an old high school crush who now sees him in a new light.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >But his most powerful partner just might be the beautiful but ruthless burglar he\u2019s been pursuing for years.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870370/extras/e34a4806b7fe966f376c788b3094645a.poster.avif?t=1773300903\" width=780 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870370/extras/e34a4806b7fe966f376c788b3094645a.webm?t=1773300903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870370/extras/e34a4806b7fe966f376c788b3094645a.mp4?t=1773300903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870370/extras/ef1d9201907932788f45a440dc181cc1.poster.avif?t=1773300903\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870370/extras/ef1d9201907932788f45a440dc181cc1.webm?t=1773300903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870370/extras/ef1d9201907932788f45a440dc181cc1.mp4?t=1773300903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate a string of murders, follow the clues and solve the case in this gripping story written by  bestselling author Aaron Crash, author of <i>Denver Fury</i> and <i>Barbarian Outcast</i>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870370/extras/23dfd3a796e70410d6207e58ca445367.poster.avif?t=1773300903\" width=780 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870370/extras/23dfd3a796e70410d6207e58ca445367.webm?t=1773300903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870370/extras/23dfd3a796e70410d6207e58ca445367.mp4?t=1773300903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870370/extras/76e7221153b9467c84fc529103734122.poster.avif?t=1773300903\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870370/extras/76e7221153b9467c84fc529103734122.webm?t=1773300903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870370/extras/76e7221153b9467c84fc529103734122.mp4?t=1773300903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy action packed fight scenes as you take down criminals and catch supervillains. Get to the truth one punch at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870370/extras/1bcb14699038fdf2aaa4ea042a947832.poster.avif?t=1773300903\" width=780 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870370/extras/1bcb14699038fdf2aaa4ea042a947832.webm?t=1773300903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870370/extras/1bcb14699038fdf2aaa4ea042a947832.mp4?t=1773300903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870370/extras/b27cc071fa83197850b5e78244063962.webp?t=1773300903\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870370/extras/b27cc071fa83197850b5e78244063962.poster.avif?t=1773300903\" class=\"bb_img\" width=780 height=438 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick the choices that influence dialogue and action in a fully immersive experience where story, art, sound, and music let you be the superhero you\u2019ve always wanted to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Finding this killer is going to take a lot of leg work. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></